config PCMCIA
    bool

config PCMCIA_MODEM
    bool
    default y if PCMCIA
    depends on PCMCIA
    select SERIAL
    help
      16-bit serial PC Card modem devices.

config I82092AA
    bool
    default y if PCI_DEVICES
    depends on PCI
    select PCMCIA
    help
      Intel 82092AA PCI-to-PCMCIA bridge.  The initial model exposes PPEC
      function 0 and its 82365SL-compatible ExCA socket-register interface
      with selectable one-, two-, or four-socket hardware profiles.
